<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>TANKERS.</p>
<p>Skua Venture - (built 1975) 131,664 dwt sold to Japanese buyers for $33 million.</p>
<p>New Tatina - (built 1976) 96,550 dwt sold to Mideast buyers for $6.8 million.</p>
<p>Torm Kristina - (built 1986) 77,788 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $25.4 million.</p>
<p>Plumeria - (built 1982) 38,620 dwt sold to Italian buyers for $13.1 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
</text>
